OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foccasional outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle for much of the night,
OL,8,Falthough the odd clear spell cannot be
OL,9,Fruled out. A band of rain, locally
OL,10,Fheavy, then moves into western parts
OL,11,Fbefore dawn. Winds strengthening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FBlustery rainband, locally
OL,14,Fheavy, continues east at first, but
OL,15,Fsoon clears. Sunny spells and
OL,16,Foccasional showers follow, heavy at
OL,17,Ftimes. Staying rather windy, with
OL,18,Fupland and coastal gales. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
