OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FChilly
OL,6,Fbut fine start Wednesday, before cloud
OL,7,Fgradually thickens, with strengthening
OL,8,Fwinds. Cloudy, with rain Thursday, and
OL,9,Fwinds easing a little. Mild,
OL,10,Fespecially overnight. Sunny spells
OL,11,FFriday and feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
